  ($$forearm_mappings_v1$$, $$cat-409:forearm.ecrl$$, $$cat-409$$, $$forearm.ecrl$$, $$wrist.extension$$, $$stabilizer$$, $$isometric$$, $$emg$$, $$individual$$, false, $$A heavy handle held at the side needs the wrist held straight while the fingers grip, and the wrist extensors work alongside a grip (M2): isometric stabilization, never dynamic credit (brief §4, farmer carry: wrist stabilization).$$, $$reviewed$$),
